# ==========================================
# ZioVenture / Reinsteins WorkHub -- CLIENT environment template
# (Phase 15A)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in the client/ directory for a local
# override, or (more commonly) set VITE_API_URL as a build-time
# environment variable on whatever platform builds/deploys the
# frontend (Vercel, Netlify, a CI pipeline, etc). Vite only exposes
# variables prefixed VITE_ to client-side code -- never put a secret
# here, this file's contents end up readable in the built JS bundle.
# ==========================================

# Origin of the deployed backend API (server/app.js), no trailing
# slash. Used for every REST call and the Socket.IO connection
# (client/src/config.js). Optional -- defaults to
# http://localhost:5000 if unset, which is correct for local dev
# against the backend's default PORT.
#
# Production example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.zioventure.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
